# KTX for OpenFL — unit tests with the Starling bridge, C++ target
#
# Starling references legacy flash.* types; OpenFL's project tooling remaps
# them automatically (see openfl's include.xml), so a bare hxml build does the
# same here.
-lib lime
-lib openfl
-lib utest
-lib starling
--remap flash:openfl
-cp src
-cp tests
-main TestMain
-cpp bin/cpp-starling
